puede gestionarse de manera m\u00e1s \u00e1gil.<\/p>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"sap-section-dark row-2-col-2\">\r\n    <h3>Acceso remoto y colaboraci\u00f3n<\/h3>\r\n    <p>Los usuarios pueden trabajar desde diferentes ubicaciones manteniendo altos niveles de productividad.<\/p>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"sap-section-dark row-2-col-2\">\r\n    <h3>Preparaci\u00f3n para el crecimiento<\/h3>\r\n    <p>Las soluciones en la nube permiten acompa\u00f1ar la expansi\u00f3n organizacional.<\/p>\r\n  <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4495feb elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"4495feb\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-acbde1c\" data-id=\"acbde1c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16742bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"16742bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>\u00bfQu\u00e9 soluciones SAP Cloud existen?<\/b><\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8ecf5d elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"c8ecf5d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<link href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Raleway:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n.sap-cloud-solutions{\r\n    font-family:'Raleway',sans-serif;\r\n    max-width:1100px;\r\n    margin:auto;\r\n    color:#000;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-cloud-solutions p{\r\n    margin:0 0 18px;\r\n    line-height:1.6;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-cloud-intro{\r\n    font-weight:600;\r\n    color:#23293E;\r\n    margin-bottom:28px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-cloud-grid{\r\n    display:grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);\r\n    gap:24px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-cloud-card{\r\n    padding:24px;\r\n    background:#FAFAFA;\r\n    border:1px solid #E8E8E8;\r\n    border-radius:14px;\r\n    transition:.25s;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-cloud-card:hover{\r\n    transform:translateY(-3px);\r\n    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(35,41,62,.08);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-cloud-card h3{\r\n    margin:0 0 10px;\r\n    font-size:1.2em;\r\n    font-weight:700;\r\n    color:#000;\r\n    position:relative;\r\n    padding-left:18px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-cloud-card h3::before{\r\n    content:\"\";\r\n    position:absolute;\r\n    left:0;\r\n    top:.52em;\r\n    width:8px;\r\n    height:8px;\r\n    background:#AE2661;\r\n    border-radius:50%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sap-cloud-card p{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n    line-height:1.55;\r\n}\r\n\r\n@media(max-width:768px){\r\n\r\n    .sap-cloud-grid{\r\n        grid-template-columns:1fr;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n}\r\n<\/style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"sap-cloud-solutions\">\r\n\r\n    <p>\r\n        Dependiendo de la estrategia tecnol\u00f3gica de cada organizaci\u00f3n, SAP ofrece diferentes alternativas basadas en la nube.\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <p class=\"sap-cloud-intro\">\r\n        Entre las m\u00e1s relevantes destacan:\r\n    <\/p>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sap-cloud-grid\">\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"sap-cloud-card\">\r\n            <h3>SAP S\/4HANA Cloud<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n                Orientada a organizaciones que buscan modernizar su ERP mediante un enfoque basado en la nube.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"sap-cloud-card\">\r\n            <h3>SAP SuccessFactors<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n                Plataforma enfocada en la gesti\u00f3n del talento humano.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"sap-cloud-card\">\r\n            <h3>SAP Business Technology Platform (BTP)<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n                Dise\u00f1ada para impulsar iniciativas relacionadas con integraci\u00f3n, innovaci\u00f3n y desarrollo de aplicaciones.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"sap-cloud-card\">\r\n            <h3>Soluciones h\u00edbridas<\/h3>\r\n            <p>\r\n                Permiten combinar entornos locales y servicios basados en la nube.\r\n            <\/p>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1095caa\" data-id=\"1095caa\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4855246 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4855246\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"524\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/SAP-Cloud-existen-1024x671.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-726\" alt=\"SAP Cloud\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/SAP-Cloud-existen-1024x671.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/SAP-Cloud-existen-300x197.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/SAP-Cloud-existen-768x503.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/es\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/SAP-Cloud-existen.jpg 1091w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b4936a7 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-content-bottom elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"b4936a7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6c2a1fb\" data-id=\"6c2a1fb\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0bf9c90 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"0bf9c90\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<link href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Raleway:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<style>\r\n  .sap-grid-container {\r\n    font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;\r\n    font-size: 1em;\r\n    color: #FFFFFF;\r\n    line-height: 1.25; \/* Interlineado bien compacto *\/\r\n    \r\n    \/* Configuraci\u00f3n de la rejilla base a 10 columnas para permitir proporciones exactas (30% \/ 70% y 50% \/ 50%) *\/\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 1fr);\r\n    column-gap: 30px; \/* Espacio horizontal entre las tarjetas *\/\r\n    row-gap: 30px;    \/* Espacio vertical entre las tarjetas *\/\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  \/* Estilos para cada tarjeta contenedora *\/\r\n  .sap-section {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n    border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; \/* Borde blanco de 2px *\/\r\n    border-radius: 18px;       \/* Esquinas redond